  "title": "Regions Reports Earnings of $549 Million and EPS of $0.64 in 2Q 2026",
  "summary": "Regions Financial Corp. (NYSE:RF) today reported second quarter 2026 earnings of $549 million and diluted EPS of $0.64. On an adjusted basis, earnings (1) were $583 million, with diluted EPS (1) of $0.68. Total revenue remained relatively stable while diluted EPS increased 8 percent compared to second quarter of 2025. Adjusted total revenue (1) increased 2 percent, and adjusted diluted EPS (1) increased 13 percent compared to second quarter of 2025. Financial Highlights Soundness Quarter Ended L",
